SUMMARY:Rosh Chodesh Iyyar
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the new moon festival of Rosh Chodesh Iyyar with Cantor Greenberg and your Ner Tamid sisters on Thursday evening\, May 14\, 2026 at 7 pm at Temple Ner Tamid. \nThis month we will take inspiration from the practice of Sefirat HaOmer\, the counting of the days between Passover and Shavuot. We will explore the essential healing light that comes from a deepened relationship with our middot\, the measure of our character traits\, and how each are strengthened and supported by the sefirot\, the emanations of God’s character. \nCome sing\, share\, and seek. \nRegister Here!
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/rosh-chodesh-iyyar/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
END:VEVENT
