DESCRIPTION:Annually\, Temple Ner Tamid gathers our membership for our formal Congregational Meeting. Our agenda will include the approval of the incoming slate for the Board of Trustees and Annual Budget\, along with an update on our Capital Campaign\, Eternally Strong. More details regarding the meeting’s agenda will be shared in the coming weeks.
