SUMMARY:Tikkun Leil Shavuot
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Shavuot community celebration on Thursday evening\, May 21 beginning at 7:00pm with Bnai Keshet\, \n Shomrei Emunah\, Temple Ner Tamid\, and Temple Sholom of West Essex. Taking place this year at Temple Ner Tamid\, we will gather together for a night of prayer\, study\, and Torah. In addition to our classes\, taught by local clergy and congregants\, we will be joined by scholar Moulie Vidas\, Associate Professor of Religion at Princeton University and the author of numerous works on the Talmud including the National Book award finalist The Rise of Talmud. \nClick Here to Register!
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/tikkun-leil-shavuot/
END:VEVENT
